Package: com.be-huge.insulation
Name: insulation
Version: 0.0.22
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: 解除温控，一切从简即可。内置 ChargeLimiter 功能（充电上限、回充下限、暂停/恢复充电、温度保护），全部在插件页面内直接生效，不安装也不打开桌面 app。代码基于开源项目 https://github.com/be-huge/insulation 重建
Maintainer: doimty
Author: be-huge & doimty
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, firmware (>= 12.2)
